(7735308, 1274974, 103142, '<td valign="top">Hmmm -- sorry... I''ve seen you do a lot better. The selection around your head is a little uncomfortable. And if you''re cropping off just a little from the top, I''d consider cropping up from the bottom quite a bit. The whole lower half of the photo really isn''t adding anything to it - rather detracting.<br/> <br/>(sorry, feel like I''m being overly harsh, but thought I''d comment anyway. :/)</td>', 'Hmmm -- sorry... I''ve seen you do a lot better. The selection around your head is a little uncomfortable. And if you''re cropping off just a little from the top, I''d consider cropping up from the bottom quite a bit. The whole lower half of the photo really isn''t adding anything to it - rather detracting. (sorry, feel like I''m being overly harsh, but thought I''d comment anyway. :/)', '2022-12-22 15:36:45.000000', NULL, 1),
