(7735337, 1274973, 114285, '<td valign="top">Never guessed this as yours, thought it was Georges maybe, what is it and did you eat it lol!</td>', 'Never guessed this as yours, thought it was Georges maybe, what is it and did you eat it lol!', '2022-12-23 00:11:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(7735339, 1274973, 63398, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Never guessed this as yours, thought it was Georges maybe, what is it and did you eat it lol! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The body is small cloves of black garlic, the claws are the shells from that, the reddish stuff is hot pepper sauce. The legs are pickles slices, the head is an oyster with a pimiento tongue. The round slice above the head is a pickled egg with a blue cheese stuffed olive slice and the big hemisphere is a purple onion. The tentacles above are pasta and the green things at the corners of the block are nuts. Oh yeah, that''s a big hunk of Himalayan pink salt. I don''t know what the green stuff is.....she''s asleep.<br/> <br/>And no, we didn''t eat it.</td>', 'Originally posted by Neat: Never guessed this as yours, thought it was Georges maybe, what is it and did you eat it lol!   The body is small cloves of black garlic, the claws are the shells from that, the reddish stuff is hot pepper sauce. The legs are pickles slices, the head is an oyster with a pimiento tongue. The round slice above the head is a pickled egg with a blue cheese stuffed olive slice and the big hemisphere is a purple onion. The tentacles above are pasta and the green things at the corners of the block are nuts. Oh yeah, that''s a big hunk of Himalayan pink salt. I don''t know what the green stuff is.....she''s asleep. And no, we didn''t eat it.', '2022-12-23 00:20:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7735340, 1274930, 63398, '<td valign="top">I thought this was very good. Congrats on your Blue!</td>', 'I thought this was very good. Congrats on your Blue!', '2022-12-23 00:21:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(7735341, 1274973, 114285, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NikonJeb:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Neat:</b></div><hr/><i> Never guessed this as yours, thought it was Georges maybe, what is it and did you eat it lol! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>The body is small cloves of black garlic, the claws are the shells from that, the reddish stuff is hot pepper sauce. The legs are pickles slices, the head is an oyster with a pimiento tongue. The round slice above the head is a pickled egg with a blue cheese stuffed olive slice and the big hemisphere is a purple onion. The tentacles above are pasta and the green things at the corners of the block are nuts. Oh yeah, that''s a big hunk of Himalayan pink salt. I don''t know what the green stuff is.....she''s asleep.<br/> <br/>And no, we didn''t eat it. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Haha, that''s the creativity in you both :)</td>', 'Originally posted by NikonJeb: Originally posted by Neat: Never guessed this as yours, thought it was Georges maybe, what is it and did you eat it lol!   The body is small cloves of black garlic, the claws are the shells from that, the reddish stuff is hot pepper sauce. The legs are pickles slices, the head is an oyster with a pimiento tongue. The round slice above the head is a pickled egg with a blue cheese stuffed olive slice and the big hemisphere is a purple onion. The tentacles above are pasta and the green things at the corners of the block are nuts. Oh yeah, that''s a big hunk of Himalayan pink salt. I don''t know what the green stuff is.....she''s asleep. And no, we didn''t eat it.   Haha, that''s the creativity in you both :)', '2022-12-23 00:23:03.000000', NULL, 0),
